title Songs: the three demo songs opened, played through their scenes, performed, edited, saved and opened again
covers mute-queue, reload-on-the-bar, sample-r3-kit-per-track
needs demo-songs
# The demo songs are put in the run's own library (RAM only on the MPC)
# before the first step; each is a full arrangement with several kits and
# synth tracks, so these windows are the round's realistic song load.
wait 2
mark night-market-open
button BROWSE
tap browser place Projects
tap browser row Night Market
tap browser row Night Market
wait 1
expect project: Night Market is in
mark night-market-play
tap header tab Arrange
tap clips scene Scene 1
tap transport play Play
wait 10.43
tap clips scene Scene 2
wait 10.43
mark night-market-perform
button SHIFT + MAIN
button TRACK MUTE
pad 2 100
wait 5.22
pad 2 100
wait 5.22
button TRACK MUTE
expect muted on the next bar
expect plays on the next bar
button SHIFT + MAIN
mark night-market-save
tap record row-more Tempo ›
button SHIFT + BROWSE
wait 1
expect project: saved Night Market
button STOP
button STOP
mark glass-garden-open
button BROWSE
tap browser place Projects
tap browser row Glass Garden
tap browser row Glass Garden
wait 1
expect project: Glass Garden is in
mark glass-garden-play
tap header tab Arrange
tap clips scene Scene 1
tap transport play Play
wait 7.74
tap clips scene Scene 2
wait 7.74
mark glass-garden-perform
button SHIFT + MAIN
button TRACK MUTE
pad 2 100
wait 3.87
pad 2 100
wait 3.87
button TRACK MUTE
expect muted on the next bar
expect plays on the next bar
button SHIFT + MAIN
mark glass-garden-save
tap record row-more Tempo ›
button SHIFT + BROWSE
wait 1
expect project: saved Glass Garden
button STOP
button STOP
mark tidal-suite-open
button BROWSE
tap browser place Projects
tap browser row Tidal Suite
tap browser row Tidal Suite
wait 1
expect project: Tidal Suite is in
mark tidal-suite-play
tap header tab Arrange
tap clips scene Scene 1
tap transport play Play
wait 12.63
tap clips scene Scene 2
wait 12.63
mark tidal-suite-perform
button SHIFT + MAIN
button TRACK MUTE
pad 2 100
wait 6.32
pad 2 100
wait 6.32
button TRACK MUTE
expect muted on the next bar
expect plays on the next bar
button SHIFT + MAIN
mark tidal-suite-save
tap record row-more Tempo ›
button SHIFT + BROWSE
wait 1
expect project: saved Tidal Suite
button STOP
button STOP
mark reopen
button BROWSE
tap browser place Projects
tap browser row Night Market
tap browser row Night Market
wait 1
expect project: Night Market is in
# Opened again: the tempo as saved, a step up from the song's 92.
expect tempo 93.0 BPM
tap header tab Arrange
tap clips scene Scene 1
tap transport play Play
wait 5
button STOP
button STOP
